    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac{28}{5}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2(x+4)+3(x-2)}6&=5\\\\2x+8+3x-6&=30\\\\5x+2&=30\\\\5x&=28\\\\x&=\\frac{28}{5}.\\end{align*}$$",
